{"4433750": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Alice on Delivery", "steam_appid": 4433750, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4433750/extras/53f35fff5dec6f1c5da99afa94928a87.avif?t=1781317972\" width=1157 height=107 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>ABOUT THIS GAME</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alice on Delivery is a bespoke, hand-drawn delivery game that follows Alice through a magical realm full of whimsical characters and mysterious intrigue. Sit back and relax as you explore the city, befriend and uncover the secrets of the residents, and become the Heartlier's best post office worker!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4433750/extras/da0e3ade9ece7436d499889d5d707a4f.poster.avif?t=1781317972\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4433750/extras/da0e3ade9ece7436d499889d5d707a4f.webm?t=1781317972\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4433750/extras/da0e3ade9ece7436d499889d5d707a4f.mp4?t=1781317972\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Signed, Sealed, Delivered!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Help Alice deliver the right packages to their proper recipients. Visit tons of shops and explore the city to discover new items, but don’t get too distracted! No one likes a late delivery. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4433750/extras/9c569b1e8077be0ff0a1b3857abad55d.avif?t=1781317972\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4433750/extras_big/9c569b1e8077be0ff0a1b3857abad55d.webp?t=1781317972 width=1560 height=3949 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Befriend the Locals!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet over 15 unique residents from Heartlier, Spaden, Clodia. Uncover each character’s backstory through deliveries and interactions, building up your relationships over time. If you become good enough friends, you may even help shape their destiny! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4433750/extras/c42991b89f55c0488ca727948c1b6852.poster.avif?t=1781317972\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4433750/extras/c42991b89f55c0488ca727948c1b6852.webm?t=1781317972\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4433750/extras/c42991b89f55c0488ca727948c1b6852.mp4?t=1781317972\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Let’s Make Some Memories!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You’re surrounded by local celebrities and stunning vistas-- time to bring out the camera! Keep track of your progress and immortalize your friends by snapping pictures around town. You can then personalize your snapshots in a journal packed with stickers and charms to decorate your adventures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4433750/extras/a76d0bad0ecd5a97e6eab5a367e0158b.poster.avif?t=1781317972\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4433750/extras/a76d0bad0ecd5a97e6eab5a367e0158b.webm?t=1781317972\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4433750/extras/a76d0bad0ecd5a97e6eab5a367e0158b.mp4?t=1781317972\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hack and Slash!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alice’s axe isn’t just for show! While exploring, Alice will discover both friends and foes. Help her fight the villains who threaten peace within the realm. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Marvelous Melodies!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each track in Alice on Delivery has been lovingly composed by its solo developer. Enjoy revamped nursery rhyme classics alongside original tracks designed just for the game, each painstakingly rendered to immerse you in this beautiful world. </p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4433750/extras/53f35fff5dec6f1c5da99afa94928a87.avif?t=1781317972\" width=1157 height=107 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>ABOUT THIS GAME</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alice on Delivery is a bespoke, hand-drawn delivery game that follows Alice through a magical realm full of whimsical characters and mysterious intrigue. Sit back and relax as you explore the city, befriend and uncover the secrets of the residents, and become the Heartlier's best post office worker!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_as